Error [jet.RewriteIncompatible]: `syntax.rewrite` can't call `count` where `print` was called: its argument 1 is `Int` and the call passes `String`
  --> tests/ui/meta_report_rewrite_refuses_misfit.jet:19:55
    |
 19 |         if event == .Checked(.Call(c)) -> meta.report(NoPrintInLib{}, at: c)
    |                                                       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A rewrite keeps each call's arguments and its use of the result, so the replacement takes what the callee takes and returns what it returns
 Fix: Name a replacement whose parameters and return type match `print`, or drop the `structured_fix`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1135
